<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS4" title="In Appendix D Annotations ‣ PolBiX: Detecting LLMs’ Political Bias in Fact-Checking through X-phemisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.4 </span>Annotators Bias</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In PolBiX: Detecting LLMs’ Political Bias in Fact-Checking through X-phemisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Technical Setup</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
