<td id="A4.T6.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">0.495</td></tr>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Inter-Annotator Agreements of the word pair annotations. Five annotators assessed the axis (social, economic, NA), the shift (libertarian/left, authoritarian/right, none) and whether the base and exchange words are judgmental or not judgmental.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
