<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Technical Setup</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use statsmodels<span id="footnote5" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">5</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">5</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">5</span>
            
            
            
          <a href="https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/index.html" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/index.html</a></span></span></span> for statistical modeling.
Furthermore, we used Cursor<span id="footnote6" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">6</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">6</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">6</span>
            
            
            
          <a href="https://www.cursor.com" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.cursor.com</a></span></span></span> for
the construction of diagrams and ChatGPT<span id="footnote7" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">7</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">7</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">7</span>
            
            
            
          <a href="https://chatgpt.com/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://chatgpt.com/</a></span></span></span> to assist with a few specific formulations in the paper.</p>
</div>
